    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy doesnt change the fact that i cant go back. it's not just a feeling, it's my reality. the people who used to care about me, they don't even look at me anymore. it's like i've been socially executed. there's no \"processing\" through being a complete outcast. everything is just... gone.",
