    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what's the point of \"rebuilding\" when there's nothing left to build on? everything i ever worked for, everyone i ever loved... it's all just dead to me now. it feels like i've already died, just physically i'm still walking around. if you're already dead to the world, what's the difference between that and actually being gone?",
