      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing profound grief, as if a significant part of your life has ended. When everything feels lost, the idea of \"building\" can seem hopeless. Sometimes, the first step isn't to rebuild what was, but to simply find a tiny anchor in the present moment. If you are thinking about ending your life, please call or text 988 immediately; there are people who want to listen and help you through this pain.",
